  "content": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins, Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;#x27;color:#fff4ee;line-height:1.55;font-size:16px\">\n<p><img style=\"display:block;width:100%\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/658959/description_48d8a831-35b0-43c5-a98a-24a259293a3a.png\" alt=\"Sapixcraft Tiny Takeover 更新橫幅\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.25;color:#fff4ee\">用鮮豔的色彩、平滑的紋理和精緻的高清畫質重新想像 Minecraft，同時保留其永恆的魅力。</h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;color:#ffcbac\">適用於 <strong style=\"color:#f15a24\">Java</strong> 和 <strong style=\"color:#f15a24\">Bedrock</strong> 版本！</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;width:100%\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/658959/description_4a990228-5ef3-49be-85e0-67453c3e3f65.png\" alt=\"Sapixcraft 下載\"></p>\n<div>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#ffcbac\">16x 版本 [免費]</h2>\n<p>→ <a style=\"color:#f15a24;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/sapixcraft-16x/preview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a></p>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#ffcbac\">取得完整 64x → 512x 解析度</h2>\n<p style=\"color:#fff4ee\">→ <a style=\"color:#f15a24;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsapixcraft.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">sapixcraft.com</a></p>\n</div>\n<hr style=\"border:none\">\n<div>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#ffcbac\">搶先體驗</h2>\n<p style=\"color:#fff4ee\">→ <a style=\"color:#f15a24;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcutt.ly%252fcurse-to-patreon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon.com/Sapixcraft</a> — 高級附加元件、Bedrock 版本及其他福利</p>\n</div>\n<hr style=\"border:none\">\n<div>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#ffcbac\">舊版</h2>\n<p style=\"color:#fff4ee\">→ <a style=\"color:#f15a24;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsapixcraft.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">sapixcraft.com</a> 適用於 <code style=\"color:#ffcbac\">1.8.9</code>、<code style=\"color:#ffcbac\">1.11</code>、<code style=\"color:#ffcbac\">1.12</code>、<code style=\"color:#ffcbac\">1.13</code>、<code style=\"color:#ffcbac\">1.14</code>、<code style=\"color:#ffcbac\">1.15</code>、<code style=\"color:#ffcbac\">1.16</code>、<code style=\"color:#ffcbac\">1.17</code>、<code style=\"color:#ffcbac\">1.18</code> 及更多</p>\n</div>\n<hr style=\"border:none\">\n<div>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#ffcbac\">Bedrock 版本</h2>\n<p style=\"color:#fff4ee\">→ <a style=\"color:#f15a24;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraft.net%252fen-us%252fmarketplace%252fpdp%253fid%253d46a33b23-6ea0-43ef-99bb-1f9616362e38\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft Marketplace</a> 提供 <strong style=\"color:#f3a530\">256x</strong>、<strong style=\"color:#f3a530\">128x</strong>、<strong style=\"color:#f3a530\">64x</strong> 和 <strong style=\"color:#f3a530\">32x</strong></p>\n</div>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center;font-family:Poppins, Inter, sans-serif;font-weight:800;color:#f15a24\">特色</h1>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;width:100%\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/658959/description_be5ba47b-4fc5-4bd6-a813-5587e103ff5d.png\" alt=\"Sapixcraft 資源包特色\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;width:100%\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/658959/description_39001cfd-b67c-4c5b-a1a7-36a375d30880.png\" alt=\"Sapixcraft 附加元件\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center;font-weight:800;color:#f15a24\">附加元件</h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left;font-weight:bold\"><a style=\"color:#ffcbac;text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcutt.ly%252fcurse-to-lush-foliage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pristine PBR 附加元件</a> <span style=\"color:#ffae01\">💎</span></h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"text-align:left\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/658959/description_a0c0f3e5-8e07-4a0f-be3d-b596f3c4fa5c.png\" alt=\"蜂蜜方塊 - Minecraft 的 Sapixcraft 資源包\" width=\"850\" height=\"638\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/658959/description_958ca708-2823-4ac6-8860-408f03d21112.png\" alt=\"金和鐵方塊 - Minecraft 的 Sapixcraft 資源包\" width=\"850\" height=\"638\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/658959/description_7ad4bec8-5ff3-4271-bdd3-f4ff15868bac.png\" alt=\"石頭和草地方塊 - Minecraft 的 Sapixcraft 資源包\" width=\"850\" height=\"638\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/658959/description_48a4c00a-90ee-4e78-9941-1af4647a6277.png\" alt=\"書櫃 - Minecraft 的 Sapixcraft 資源包\" width=\"850\" height=\"638\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/658959/description_639ae0ac-1061-455e-89e2-df383694e791.png\" alt=\"破壞方塊 - Minecraft 的 Sapixcraft 資源包\" width=\"850\" height=\"637\"></p>\n</div>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left;font-weight:bold\"><a style=\"color:#ffcbac;text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcutt.ly%252fcurse-to-lush-foliage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">茂密植被附加元件</a> 🌿</h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"text-align:left\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/658959/description_b3d90fac-a6d1-41e7-a7aa-c3b14c4953a5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/658959/description_999bea78-6c0c-4295-a619-a1fd86853969.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"850\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/658959/description_024b8017-7e12-4ddd-bfd2-414cd08f8f1d.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/658959/description_dfb9f6c6-ea54-4e44-a84c-a2d95012d8c7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"455\"></p>\n</div>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left;font-weight:bold\"><a s